editor_description = "glTF import contract (architecture.md §6): .glb, +Y up, 1 unit = 1 m, transforms applied, characters face -Z, origin at the feet (characters, standing props) or bounds-min corner (kit). Suffixes: -col trimesh collision, -convcol convex, -noimp skipped, -navmesh. Blender action anim_<name> imports as clip <name>. Materials named toon_* get the shared toon material. Rig: SkeletonProfileHumanoid names, A-pose, LeftLowerArm present. See tests/scenes/README.md."

